    ...text('After the eleven steps, the file has six field-test entries between 2026-10-12 and 2026-10-14: the 2026-10-12 test and then final loop rounds 1 to 5. The 2026-10-12 test was planned from 16 angles and had run only four when it was written up. The file admits the rest were not run and that the list of their names was not recorded in the repo.'),
