    ...text('The entry for final loop round 1 on 2026-10-13 says a full 16-angle field test (470 checks) plus the new spec suite found its bugs, and that each has a regression test in the matching spec. Later rounds pick off what the previous one left open. Examples of bugs recorded this way: a nested commit-less repository broke a snapshot; refs named foo and foo/bar collided; a module rename did not update the pub mod declaration; the debounced mid-insert auto-save split the undo block; a quit during LSP start left servers running.'),
